Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}本字幕來源互聯網  原製作者： 漫游字幕组
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:10.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}感謝字幕組及製作字幕個人的辛勤勞動與付出
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:15.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}字幕由kewenyu重新製作以適應重製版
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.12,0:00:04.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我要去看看
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.28,0:00:07.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,PLANT的情況
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.45,0:00:12.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,尋找道路也需要線索
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.19,0:00:15.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不可以  你在PLANT會…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.21,0:00:18.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事的 基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.40,0:00:21.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不用擔心我
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.14,0:00:26.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡 上去啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.30,0:00:34.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.12,0:00:38.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拉克絲
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.07,0:00:39.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.15,0:00:41.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我還是擔心  拉克絲
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.51,0:00:43.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我也一起去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.89,0:00:46.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不  不可以 基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.81,0:00:49.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Archangel如果沒你在
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.07,0:00:52.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,瑪琉艦長和卡嘉莉該怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.57,0:00:53.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.75,0:00:55.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我不會有事的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.14,0:01:00.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,一定會回到你身邊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.01,0:01:01.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.04,0:01:05.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真的要當心  拉克絲
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.99,0:01:06.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.15,0:01:07.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.04,0:01:15.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.94,0:01:19.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼搶走穿梭機那些人的下落呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.23,0:01:23.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在主要由葛拉斯茍隊展開搜查
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.93,0:01:24.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但仍未…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.36,0:01:27.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.67,0:01:30.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,偏偏假扮拉克絲 克萊茵來奪取穿梭機
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.84,0:01:33.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真是大膽
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.27,0:01:36.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,總之盡快找到他們
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.51,0:01:39.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然還不知道是不是聯合的伎倆
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.57,0:01:41.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但不管是什麼人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.12,0:01:44.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這麼做的理由只有一個吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.09,0:01:48.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是要藉她的形象擾亂PLANT
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.92,0:01:49.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.98,0:01:54.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,務必在他們開始行動引起奇怪的騷動之前抓住他們
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.20,0:01:55.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拜託了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.15,0:01:56.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.87,0:01:57.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.94,0:02:05.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過 該慶幸他們分開了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.00,0:02:10.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拉克絲 克萊茵和基拉 大和
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕たちは迷いながら
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,たどり着く場所を探しつづけ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,悲しくて涙流しても
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,いつか輝きにかえて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,閉ざした過去が今
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,胸を搖さぶるから
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,求めるほど遠く
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,置き去りの心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕らは生きるほど何かを失って
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,それでも明日への
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,夢を捨てたくない
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,悲しみの理由でさえも
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,つよく抱きしめていたい
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,通りすぎた季節のその先に
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,なにがあるのだろう
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕たちは迷いながら
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,たどり着く場所を探しつづけ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,悲しくて涙流しても
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,いつか輝きにかえて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Couse I never do not stopping my dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.61,0:04:04.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他們在何時何地 又是因何而相遇
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.71,0:04:05.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我不得而知
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.73,0:04:09.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,救生艇
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.60,0:04:18.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你們 辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.56,0:04:25.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 快住手
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.12,0:04:27.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別開玩笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.91,0:04:31.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼我非要和你握手不可
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.64,0:04:34.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,明明是協調者
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.38,0:04:35.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,少來這一套了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.16,0:04:39.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,又必須待在這裡了嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.08,0:04:45.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.93,0:04:47.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真是無聊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.88,0:04:49.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,總是一個人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.77,0:04:53.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我也想在那邊和大家一起聊天一起用餐
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.84,0:04:55.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為這是地球軍的船艦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.90,0:05:02.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,也是有人不喜歡協調者的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.99,0:05:05.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,而且現在還是敵對關係
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.90,0:05:10.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真是遺憾
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.09,0:05:15.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是你很溫柔呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.24,0:05:17.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.26,0:05:24.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為…我也是協調者
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.49,0:05:28.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.45,0:05:31.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是你的溫柔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.65,0:05:33.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是出於你本身的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.65,0:05:36.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,能告訴我你的名字嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.39,0:05:41.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我…我叫基拉  基拉 大和
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.37,0:05:43.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.94,0:05:45.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你 基拉先生
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.16,0:05:50.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拉克絲 克萊茵是當時的最高評議會議長
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.09,0:05:53.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,希格爾 克萊茵的女兒
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.55,0:05:54.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,也是巴特利葛 薩拉的兒子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.49,0:05:58.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭 薩拉的未婚妻
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.30,0:06:02.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,話說回來 她是你的未婚妻嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.83,0:06:03.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.69,0:06:06.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,結合薩拉委員長和克萊茵議長的血緣
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.44,0:06:11.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你們的婚約 將使下一代更加光明吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.79,0:06:13.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我衷心期待著
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.30,0:06:14.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.21,0:06:18.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那為何又會與他相遇呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.39,0:06:20.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,重複報導一次
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.29,0:06:24.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為了準備週年哀悼儀式慰靈團的出行
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.53,0:06:29.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,前往Junius 7的視察船 Silver Wind在昨晚失去音訊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.98,0:06:31.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拉克絲
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.01,0:06:45.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不要！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.81,0:06:49.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,通告ZAFT軍
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.52,0:06:52.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡是地球聯合軍所屬艦 Archangel
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.75,0:06:56.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,本艦現在正對PLANT最高評議會議長
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.27,0:06:58.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,希格爾 克萊茵的女兒
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.96,0:07:00.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拉克絲 克萊茵進行保護
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.30,0:07:01.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.35,0:07:04.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,太卑鄙了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.10,0:07:10.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,將救出的平民當作人質
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.68,0:07:14.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,和這種卑鄙小人並肩作戰 這就是你的正義嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.03,0:07:15.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.48,0:07:17.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.88,0:07:18.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,騙子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.46,0:07:21.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是說會沒事嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.49,0:07:23.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是說了"我們也去 沒事的"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.05,0:07:27.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼沒保護好爸爸的船
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.56,0:07:32.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼沒把他們全都幹掉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.43,0:07:35.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,芙蕾 基拉也是拼命地…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.43,0:07:38.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你該不會因為自己也是協調者
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.85,0:07:40.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以根本就沒認真去打吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.63,0:07:48.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸…把爸爸還給我…爸爸…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.13,0:07:50.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,芙蕾
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.04,0:07:53.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.58,0:08:04.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,發生什麼事了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.66,0:08:17.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我…我真的不想戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.71,0:08:20.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是協調者
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.91,0:08:25.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,和阿斯蘭也是很好的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.44,0:08:26.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.26,0:08:28.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,妳認識阿斯蘭?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.47,0:08:33.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭 薩拉是我的未婚夫
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.95,0:08:41.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還是不行 這種事…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.03,0:08:50.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,噓 哈囉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.18,0:08:56.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉先生
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.84,0:08:58.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.23,0:09:01.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,安靜跟我來
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.41,0:09:02.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,安靜點喔
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.75,0:09:12.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭 薩拉嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.65,0:09:14.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.98,0:09:17.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,打開駕駛艙
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.48,0:09:23.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.24,0:09:28.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,即使如此 靈魂也會互相吸引
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.98,0:09:30.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,命中注定的人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.67,0:09:33.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,命中注定的事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.85,0:09:40.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,如果全都這樣定論
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.36,0:09:45.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那我們掙扎著生存下去的意義是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.44,0:09:50.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,一切事物都會誕生 最後死去
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.02,0:09:52.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僅此而已
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.70,0:10:00.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因此所有的渴求以及希望都是無意義的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.10,0:10:03.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不 不是那個意思
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.76,0:10:06.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,只不過這就是我們這個可愛的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.30,0:10:10.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,以及人類這種生物
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.07,0:10:13.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,無論如何生活 活得怎樣
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.26,0:10:19.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,人人都知道但又忘記的事實
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.79,0:10:22.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但只有我不會忘記
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.48,0:10:24.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,絕不會忘記
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.01,0:10:28.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我這一生還有價值可言
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.33,0:10:35.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,就是自始至終從未忘記這一點吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.51,0:10:47.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 你也是希望活下去的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.72,0:10:51.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,就像要與什麼抗爭一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.86,0:10:53.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,渴望著什麼一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.42,0:11:09.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,知道願望無法實現之時
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.65,0:11:12.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們該如何是好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.35,0:11:15.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,知道那已是注定之時…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.29,0:11:28.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是你…的?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.50,0:11:34.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 謝…謝
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.09,0:11:40.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,以前 我的朋友…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.81,0:11:44.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,很重要的朋友送我的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.79,0:11:47.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是很重要的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.69,0:11:49.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.37,0:11:54.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,尼高爾
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.31,0:12:00.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,托爾
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.39,0:12:04.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.03,0:12:06.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.36,0:12:11.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這種事情我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.28,0:12:14.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我只知道我自己所知
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.79,0:12:21.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,就像要走入迷宮一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.27,0:12:27.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,總有很多條道路在你眼前
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.41,0:12:31.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們所要做的是去選擇 摸索
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.00,0:12:38.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你們深信前方將有追求之物
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.08,0:12:46.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,而我是否又已知道並沒有追求之物呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.88,0:12:53.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒辦法 我已經決定了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.74,0:12:56.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我想要一個孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.76,0:13:00.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以要遵守PLANT的規定
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.16,0:13:05.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以已經…不能和你在一起了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.83,0:13:09.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.02,0:13:14.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,到底是由誰來決定
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.66,0:13:16.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,決定什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.43,0:13:31.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.27,0:13:36.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我要走了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.52,0:13:39.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,去哪裡呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.47,0:13:43.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,地球…我得回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.95,0:13:44.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.28,0:13:47.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,即使你一個人回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.80,0:13:49.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,戰爭也不會結束
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.20,0:13:54.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可是 我沒辦法再袖手旁觀了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.69,0:13:59.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說什麼也做不到 就什麼都不去做的話
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.38,0:14:01.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,會更加一事無成
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.80,0:14:04.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼也不會改變
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.90,0:14:07.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼都不會結束
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.67,0:14:12.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,GUNDAM
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.87,0:14:17.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,只有想法或是只有力量都是不行的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.81,0:14:19.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.13,0:14:36.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有任何辦法
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.51,0:14:42.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 這真的能算是選擇嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.25,0:14:57.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,做出選擇的真的是自己嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.84,0:14:59.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拉克絲
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.17,0:15:01.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.91,0:15:06.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我沒有幫間諜引線
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.48,0:15:11.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,只是把新的劍交給基拉而已
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.42,0:15:18.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在的基拉需要它 也正適合他
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.88,0:15:19.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.94,0:15:24.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你在說什麼 基拉…他已經…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.89,0:15:26.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,被你殺了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.36,0:15:31.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,放心吧 基拉還活著
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.76,0:15:32.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,騙人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.73,0:15:35.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,只靠言語無法相信嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.33,0:15:38.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼要是你親眼見到呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.30,0:15:44.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我是敵人 你會向我開槍嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.04,0:15:46.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,ZAFT的阿斯蘭 薩拉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.05,0:15:50.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我…我…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.80,0:15:53.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,難道在沒有選擇的道路上
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.73,0:15:56.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,才有真正追求的事物嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.10,0:16:00.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在你不斷思考的時候時間已流逝殆盡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.65,0:16:08.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有選擇的道路就和不存在一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.02,0:16:13.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨…阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.82,0:16:16.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.53,0:16:18.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,如果那時…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.29,0:16:20.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,如果那時…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.26,0:16:22.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,發射
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.46,0:16:34.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,父親！父親！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.72,0:16:53.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,您是當真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.25,0:16:56.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,要消滅所有的自然人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.43,0:16:58.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這就是這場戰爭的目的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.96,0:17:02.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們正是為此而戰
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.38,0:17:04.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,難道你連這個都忘了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.39,0:17:13.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不論如何回首 都已經無法回頭
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.32,0:17:16.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼都無法改變
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.71,0:17:20.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Eternal 請出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.41,0:17:35.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.88,0:17:37.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拉克絲
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.87,0:17:38.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.21,0:17:41.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣好嗎 她是你的未婚妻吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.93,0:17:43.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,曾經是…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.21,0:17:52.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們只能朝著看不見的未來前進
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.31,0:18:01.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,穆先生
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.84,0:18:02.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.38,0:18:05.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,來吧 不必客氣
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.63,0:18:06.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,來這起源之地
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.18,0:18:11.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉 對你來說這裡也是出生的故鄉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.12,0:18:16.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,老爸?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.40,0:18:19.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,騙子 還給我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.96,0:18:21.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,快把另一個孩子還給我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.41,0:18:22.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是我的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.59,0:18:27.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我要用最強的技術讓他成為最強的協調者
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.74,0:18:28.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是為了誰
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.62,0:18:30.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為了你?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.01,0:18:32.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,最強的協調者
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.07,0:18:34.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這就是這孩子的幸福嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.11,0:18:38.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,人類總是要不斷精益求精
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.54,0:18:41.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,正因為那裡才有所謂的幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.13,0:18:43.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,克隆是違法的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.89,0:18:47.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,法律可以改變 終究是人制定的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.12,0:18:49.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.53,0:18:52.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,歷經千辛萬苦而掌握的技術
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.26,0:18:54.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不使用多可惜
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.67,0:18:57.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你也想要研究資金吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.76,0:18:59.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不是此刻的某時
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.05,0:19:01.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不是此地的某處
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.03,0:19:06.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這就是你所希望的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.25,0:19:08.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不是我的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.08,0:19:11.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是人類的夢想
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.14,0:19:13.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,人類的願望
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.68,0:19:15.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,人類的罪孽
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.31,0:19:18.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,比他人更強
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.17,0:19:20.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,比他人領先
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.92,0:19:22.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在他人之上
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.34,0:19:27.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,爭鬥 忌妒 憎恨
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.71,0:19:29.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,相互吞噬
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.92,0:19:32.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是你的歪理
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.70,0:19:33.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,休想得逞
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.14,0:19:35.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是結果
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.03,0:19:37.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以才知道
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.27,0:19:42.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,被親手孕育的黑暗所吞噬 人類終究會滅亡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.16,0:19:48.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,美好的事物一定就在那裡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.96,0:19:56.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 你…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.69,0:19:59.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不准逃避
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.10,0:20:03.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,活著才是戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.08,0:20:05.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,即使如此
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.69,0:20:09.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我還有想保護的世界啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.25,0:20:21.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為了追求它 你們會永遠徘徊在充滿鮮血的道路上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.76,0:20:27.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真是不幸啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.15,0:20:37.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不能救贖嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.91,0:20:39.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,救贖是什麼呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.26,0:20:45.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是指渴望的 希望的一切都成為現實嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.17,0:20:58.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還是希望讓時光倒流挽回悲劇?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.89,0:21:04.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,即使如此 你又有自信能說下次不會再犯錯嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.65,0:21:07.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,到底是由誰來決定
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.27,0:21:09.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,決定什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.07,0:21:14.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那就由我來改變這一切
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.79,0:21:19.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,若無法回頭
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.55,0:21:21.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,便從一開始就選擇正確的道路
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.10,0:21:26.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,腺嘌吟 鳥嘌呤 胞嘧啶 胸腺嘧啶
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.79,0:21:31.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,自己能做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.00,0:21:33.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,自己該做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.90,0:21:44.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,正因為那是自己再清楚不過的事…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,今でも氣付かないでしょう
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,この靜かな空に
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,いつでも思い出すけど
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,もうどこにももどれない
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,そしてずっと心で醒めて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,そっと氣付いて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,いつかきっとやさしさ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,見えてくるように
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,What's stopping me? I get stuck again
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Is it really OK? It's never OK for me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,What's got into me? I get lost again
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Is it really OK? It's never going to be
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.50,0:23:24.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,未能保護的人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.83,0:23:27.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,想要保護的人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.02,0:23:29.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,無法保護的人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.35,0:23:33.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,無法抓住 是因為此時的手依然弱小嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.64,0:23:37.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對痛苦的少女唯一的希望
